      "writtenOn": "2026-05-31T03:14:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Chris and Michael, I am proposing \n- creating new matrices and enums in `SkYUVMath.cpp` for matrices that include the correction for 10/12 bit in 16 bit sampling. The enums and matrices will say `SampledAs16` e.g. kBT2020_10bitSampledAs16_Limited_SkYUVColorSpace and BT2020_10bitSampledAs16_limited_yuv_to_rgb\t\n- editing the `shared_image_representation.cc` file in the Chromium source to set the appropriate enum based on Apple and Non Apple build flag. The proposed code example is in https://skia-review.googlesource.com/c/skia/+/1246536/2/PROPOSED_CHROMIUM_CL_shared_image_representations.cc#12\n\nCould you help take a look? Thanks",
      "revId": "6adbc5e5c3b7ee87dd754d66d0fddad7494deeb1",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
